{"id":47760,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47760"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:35:43","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:35:43","slug":"trail-do-marco","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-marco\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Marco 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Marco 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail do Marco 2026<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Marco de Canaveses<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Trail do Marco<\/strong> com o apoio institucional da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Marco de Canaveses<\/strong>, a prova consolidou-se como um dos grandes palcos de trail running do Norte do pa\u00eds, integrando o Circuito Nacional da <strong>ATRP<\/strong> e as prestigiadas <em>Porto Trail Series<\/em>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada instaladas no centro da cidade, junto \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal, esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rica estreia a dist\u00e2ncia m\u00edtica de <strong>Ultra Trail (50 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>07h30<\/strong>, juntando-se ao <strong>Trail Longo (31 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08h30<\/strong>, ao <strong>Trail Sprint (17 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> e \u00e0 <strong>Caminhada (12 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>. O percurso percorre os relevos verdejantes e os vales encantados entre os rios Douro e T\u00e2mega, oferecendo camisola t\u00e9cnica oficial, pr\u00e9mio finisher exclusivo e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os primeiros classificados da geral.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-wo